# Vision Search Agent — Architecture & Workflow

## High-Level Philosophy: "Index Fast, Search Smart"

The system splits the work into two phases with fundamentally different strategies:

| Phase | Strategy | Speed | AI Models Used |
|-------|----------|-------|----------------|
| **Indexing** | Dump *everything* into a vector database — fast and dumb | ~0.65 frames/s (CPU) | YOLO11n + CLIP ViT-L/14 |
| **Searching** | Apply smart, multi-stage filtering at query time | ~1-3 seconds | CLIP + YOLO-World + VLM (optional) |

---

